Z||000000||pHoOl||12-04-2000||01:37 PM||||I was looking at the f355 front facia that's available as a bolt on mod, and i was getting some ideas about doing ram air.  First question is how long can you have the pipe that would go from the scoop to the air intake.  I was just thinking that maybe one could put in two tubes from where the driving lights are supposed to be on it, and "Y" them into the air intake.  But i thought i read somewhere that it's hard to do ram air over the distance from the front to the engine. <P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
